---
// Schematic of OxyGen's per-frame flow (left) and cross-frame batching (right).
// The right panel uses the paper's illustration setting (fig:timeline):
// N = 12 tokens per request, k = 4 steps per frame, so B = 3 requests are active.
const N = 12;
const K = 4;
const B = N / K;
const FRAMES = 6;

// Left panel geometry
const W = 516;
const H = 200;

// Right panel geometry
const LW = 64; // label column
const TOP = 40; // below frame header and action lane
const ROW = 25;
const colW = (W - LW - 14) / FRAMES;
const rows = Array.from({ length: FRAMES }, (_, r) => r);
const steady = B; // first frame where the batch is full (0-based)
---

<figure class="design unit">
  <div class="fig-head"><span class="title"><span class="label"><b>Fig. 2</b></span>How OxyGen manages the KV cache</span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="c1-6">
      <div class="panel-head"><span><i class="roman">i.</i> Within a frame: one prefill, shared by every expert</span></div>
      <div class="chart">
        <svg viewBox={`0 14 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Per-frame flow: the observation is prefilled once, and the shared prefix KV cache feeds the action expert and a new language request">
          <defs>
            <marker id="dg-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
              <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="dg-head" />
            </marker>
          </defs>

          <!-- observation -->
          <g transform="translate(0 78)">
            <rect class="dg-frame" x="0" y="0" width="78" height="72" />
            {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => <rect class="dg-img" x={8 + i * 21} y="10" width="17" height="17" />)}
            <line class="dg-text-line" x1="8" x2="70" y1="40" y2="40" />
            <line class="dg-text-line" x1="8" x2="52" y1="50" y2="50" />
            <text class="dg-small" x="0" y="88">observation</text>
            <text class="dg-small" x="0" y="102">3 views, prompt</text>
          </g>
          <line class="dg-link" x1="84" y1="114" x2="110" y2="114" marker-end="url(#dg-arrow)" />

          <!-- backbone prefill -->
          <g transform="translate(114 78)">
            <rect class="dg-prefill" x="0" y="0" width="76" height="72" />
            <text class="dg-on-dark" x="38" y="32" text-anchor="middle">VLM</text>
            <text class="dg-on-dark" x="38" y="47" text-anchor="middle">prefill</text>
            <text class="dg-small" x="38" y="88" text-anchor="middle">once per frame</text>
          </g>
          <line class="dg-link" x1="196" y1="114" x2="222" y2="114" marker-end="url(#dg-arrow)" />

          <!-- shared prefix KV -->
          <g transform="translate(226 78)">
            {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((i) => <rect class="dg-kv" x="0" y={i * 12} width="64" height="9" />)}
            <text class="dg-label" x="32" y="88" text-anchor="middle">prefix KV</text>
            <text class="dg-small" x="32" y="102" text-anchor="middle">shared, read-only</text>
          </g>

          <!-- fan-out -->
          <path class="dg-link" d="M296,104 C318,104 318,52 340,52" marker-end="url(#dg-arrow)" />
          <path class="dg-link" d="M296,124 C318,124 318,176 340,176" marker-end="url(#dg-arrow)" />

          <!-- action expert -->
          <g transform="translate(344 22)">
            <rect class="dg-action" x="0" y="0" width="172" height="60" />
            <text class="dg-on-dark" x="12" y="24">Action expert</text>
            <text class="dg-on-dark-small" x="12" y="42">S denoising steps → H actions</text>
          </g>

          <!-- language state -->
          <g transform="translate(344 146)">
            <rect class="dg-frame" x="0" y="0" width="172" height="66" />
            <text class="dg-label" x="12" y="20">New language request</text>
            <rect class="dg-kv" x="12" y="30" width="44" height="16" />
            {Array.from({ length: N }, (_, i) => <rect class="dg-slot" x={60 + i * 8.6} y="30" width="6.6" height="16" />)}
            <text class="dg-small" x="12" y="59">prefix KV + room for N tokens</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="key design-key">
        <span><i style="background: var(--baseline)"></i>prefill</span>
        <span><i style="background: var(--paper-deep); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-soft)"></i>prefix KV</span>
        <span><i style="background: var(--action)"></i>action chunk</span>
        <span><i style="background: var(--language)"></i>language tokens</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="c7-12">
      <div class="panel-head"><span><i class="roman">ii.</i> Across frames: unfinished requests decode together</span></div>
      <div class="chart">
        <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${TOP + ROW * FRAMES + 30}`} role="img" aria-label={`Cross-frame batching: each request needs ${N} tokens, advances ${K} per frame, so ${B} requests decode together in every frame`}>
          <!-- frame header and action lane -->
          {rows.map((f) => (
            <g>
              <text class="dg-small" x={LW + f * colW + colW / 2} y="12" text-anchor="middle">{f === 0 ? "frame t" : `t+${f}`}</text>
              <rect class="dg-action" x={LW + f * colW + 6} y="20" width={colW - 12} height="8" />
            </g>
          ))}
          <text class="dg-small" x="0" y="28">actions</text>

          <!-- steady-state column -->
          <rect class="dg-batch" x={LW + steady * colW + 2} y={TOP - 6} width={colW - 4} height={ROW * FRAMES + 6} />

          {rows.map((r) => {
            const y = TOP + r * ROW;
            return (
              <g>
                <text class="dg-small" x="0" y={y + 14}>{r === 0 ? "request t" : `t+${r}`}</text>
                {Array.from({ length: B }, (_, j) => {
                  const f = r + j;
                  if (f >= FRAMES) return null;
                  const x0 = LW + f * colW + 6;
                  const w = colW - 12;
                  return (
                    <g>
                      {j === 0 && <rect class="dg-kv" x={x0} y={y + 3} width="8" height="13" />}
                      {Array.from({ length: K }, (_, t) => (
                        <rect class="dg-token" x={x0 + (j === 0 ? 11 : 0) + t * ((w - (j === 0 ? 11 : 0)) / K)} y={y + 3} width={(w - (j === 0 ? 11 : 0)) / K - 2.5} height="13" />
                      ))}
                      {j === B - 1 && <text class="dg-done" x={x0 + w + 3} y={y + 14}>✓</text>}
                    </g>
                  );
                })}
              </g>
            );
          })}
          <text class="dg-small" x={LW + steady * colW + colW / 2} y={TOP + ROW * FRAMES + 18} text-anchor="middle">one batched pass</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="caption c1-6">The backbone encodes each new observation once. The action expert denoises over the shared prefix KV, and a new language request starts from the same prefill instead of computing it again. Isolated execution repeats the prefill for every task.</p>
    <p class="caption c7-12">Each request needs N = {N} tokens; every frame advances all unfinished requests by k = {K} in one batch. After warm-up, {B} requests from different frames share each decoding pass, while actions keep their per-frame pace. Finished requests are evicted.</p>
  </div>
</figure>
